# SOC lab custom Snort rules.
# Status: placeholder. The rules themselves are written in Phase 3:
# port scan (SYN sweep), brute force (SSH 22 / RDP 3389),
# lateral movement (SMB 445 / WinRM 5985), each with a unique SID, a
# plain-English msg, a classtype, and a comment linking to its playbook.
# The sample alerts in src/samples/ use the signature text these rules will
# carry: "SOC LAB SCAN ...", "SOC LAB BRUTE ...", "SOC LAB LATERAL ...".
